      en: ["First mentioned in Ottoman sources in 1539.", "The current form of the church dates back to 1726 after a fire.", "The church is dedicated to the Holy Archangels Michael and Gabriel.", "The Baroque-style bell tower was added in 1883.", "The iconostasis was carved by local masters in 1734.", "The church's museum houses a collection of icons from the 13th to 19th centuries.", "The outer walls are over a meter thick."],
